# 1️⃣ Find Maximum Element

## 📖 Definition

The maximum element is the largest value present in an array.

---

### Example

```text
Array

5 12 8 25 17

Maximum = 25
```

---

### Algorithm

```
Initialize max = first element

Traverse the array

If current element > max

Update max

Return max
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
#include<iostream>
using namespace std;

int main()
{
    int arr[] = {5,12,8,25,17};
    int n = 5;

    int maximum = arr[0];

    for(int i=1;i<n;i++)
    {
        if(arr[i] > maximum)
            maximum = arr[i];
    }

    cout<<"Maximum = "<<maximum;
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

### Space Complexity

```
O(1)
```

