# 3️⃣ Find Largest and Second Largest Element

## 📖 Definition

Find both the largest and the second largest distinct element.

---

### Example

```text
Array

12 35 1 10 34 1

Largest = 35

Second Largest = 34
```

---

### Approach

Maintain two variables.

```
largest

secondLargest
```

Update both while traversing the array only once.

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

### Space Complexity

```
O(1)
```

