# 5️⃣ Check if Array is Sorted

## 📖 Definition

Determine whether the elements are arranged in non-decreasing order.

---

### Example 1

```text
1 2 3 4 5

Sorted
```

---

### Example 2

```text
2 5 4 8 10

Not Sorted
```

---

### Algorithm

```
Traverse array

If arr[i] > arr[i+1]

Return false

Otherwise

Return true
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
bool isSorted(int arr[],int n)
{
    for(int i=0;i<n-1;i++)
    {
        if(arr[i] > arr[i+1])
            return false;
    }

    return true;
}
```

---

### Time Complexity

```
O(n)
```

### Space Complexity

```
O(1)
```

